  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Two objects of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M\"></span> each are connected by a weightless rod of length <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"d\"></span>. A force <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span> is applied to each of the objects, at right angles to the rod as shown.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the torque acting on the system about the midpoint of the rod and what is the angular acceleration of the system?</p>\n<table><tbody><tr><td></td><td><p>Torque</p></td><td><p>Angular acceleration</p></td></tr><tr data-label=\"A\"><td><p>A.</p></td><td><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Fd\"></span></p></td><td><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2F}{Md}\"></span></p></td></tr><tr data-label=\"B\"><td><p>B.</p></td><td><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Fd\"></span></p></td><td><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{4F}{Md}\"></span></p></td></tr><tr data-label=\"C\"><td><p>C.</p></td><td><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2Fd\"></span></p></td><td><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2F}{Md}\"></span></p></td></tr><tr data-label=\"D\"><td><p>D.</p></td><td><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2Fd\"></span></p></td><td><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{4F}{Md}\"></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>[1]</p>"
